    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED EA) celebrated World Teachers' Day 2024 with a series of vibrant events at its Dar es Salaam campus. Hosted by the Centre for Continuing Education and Life Long Learning (CELL), the event focused on this year's theme  \"Valuing Teachers' Voices: Towards a New Social Contract for Education.\"",
